  "description": "A polling BackgroundService that never stops the host: polls on start and then every interval, logs a failed poll and tries again with exponential backoff, reports each outcome to optional hooks whose own failures are logged, and stops cleanly on shutdown. Uses TimeProvider. Native AOT compatible.",
